    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22493" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνύξ</span></b> , Adv., (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γόνυ</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with bent
				knee</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
			</span></i>, always in phrase <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνὺξ
			ἐριπών</span> falling <i>on the knee</i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.309
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				357
			</span></i>,al.; later 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ. ἥμενος</span>”
