					3.1310
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ. ἑδριοῶσαι</span> Orac. ap.
				<i><span class="en">
				Zos.
				2.6
			</span></i>: in later Prose, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
				3.15
			</span></i>.</div>
